# Portfolio SKUs

- Six sellable jobs: **Score · Cite · Radar · Ledger · Data · Sights** — each usable without GCI if buyer only wants that job.
- Compose existing services (`repository`, `research`, alerts, `promise_brief`) — no parallel data stacks.
- Catalog source: `backend/app/services/portfolio.py` · docs: `docs/PRODUCT_PORTFOLIO.md`.
- Every SKU: primary disclosure + evidence; factual only; no Buy/Hold/Sell.
- Entitlements gate features per plan ∩ role — do not union SKU access.
- Customer one-pagers: `docs/customer/skus/*.md` · UI: `/products`, `/package`.
